      "url": "https://github.com/wine-mirror/wine/blob/415a275e3844c252ad385b46023095e9401ca234/dlls/d3d9/tests/device.c",
      "evidence": "Windows missing-declaration test3171–3203: PrimitiveUP returns INVALIDCALL,stream0 becomesNULL while stride remains prior sizeof(vertex);IndexedUP returns INVALIDCALL and index buffer becomesNULL. Missing cleanup remains todo_wine. Success3220+/3259+ zeroes stream metadata;3270+ proves successful UP cleanup not recorded in stateblocks."
    },
    {
      "file": "d3d9-map-device.c",
      "blobSha1": "2d036f2c22ef92b0c3b55fccf1bb2af477c9b146",
      "sha256": "b70a5ed02fdd3e72f030d492770b13a16e8cd73b51c2ac8684e08f921af6fd58",
      "url": "https://github.com/wine-mirror/wine/blob/415a275e3844c252ad385b46023095e9401ca234/dlls/d3d9/device.c",
      "evidence": "Wine public UP3322+/3374+ validates stride/count then declaration and currently returns INVALIDCALL without native missing-declaration cleanup. Success resets internal stream/index directly. Windows tests supply missing behavior; Wine implementation is not the positive oracle for that branch."
    }
  ],
  "scope": "Stage4J11 changes only otherwise valid nonzero UP calls missing a vertex declaration: return INVALIDCALL,detach stream0 preserving old offset/stride,and indexed UP also detaches indices. Failures operate on live bindings during recording without recording cleanup. Internal patch calls use an independent public_up flag;their tracking policy and bindings stay unchanged. Other validation/status/emitter failures preserve prior policy. Native methods exercise44800 new checks,256 pool/owner profiles,8192 missing-format failures and12 strict runtime mutants. XP has3 VB/2 IB,three missing-declaration and one basic-argument refusal,16 stream and6 index queries,empty recording Capture/Apply,one bound/two UP/one indexedUP,one Reset/Clear and5 transport replies. Dual GPU independently validates320 pixels and empty maps before owner release. Failed offset/indexed metadata policy conservatively preserves existing values; Windows test only directly pins nonindexed stride and indexed null buffer. Zero-primitive UP,other retail stream/UP branches,D3D8 wrapper,native HAL,games/FPS and overall stages4/5/6 remain open. Host/protocol/shader/bundle and D3D8/DDraw unchanged.",
